<<tendingicon>><<link "抬起手臂试新衬衣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-monet-6">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_monet_6 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_monet_6")>><<money 650>><</if>>微凉滑腻的真丝贴合着肌肤，莫奈指尖顺着珍珠排扣一粒粒替你系好。<span class="green">疲惫一扫而空。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[改日清晨再聚 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	衣袖暗扣勾住了发丝，你低头时呼吸乱了节拍。<span class="red">你先停下动作平复呼吸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个支点稳住再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拿起软尺帮她复核领口尺寸 (0:09)">><<pass 9>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-monet-6">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_monet_6 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_monet_6")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>分毫不差的尺寸让衬衣宛如量身凝就，莫奈将一枚纯银领针别在你领口。<span class="green">眉眼间满是笑意。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约好下次相伴 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	软尺在指间打滑卷了边，读数偏了半寸。<span class="red">决定定下心神重新尝试。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开湿滑边缘再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Monet 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP RelDay Ash 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to ($mpNpcs.ash or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if Time.season is "autumn">>秋日清晨的林间薄雾未散，<<else>>清晨的深林薄雾未散，<</if>>阿什在守林人石屋外搭起木架熏制鹿肉。猎犬欢快地摇尾迎上来，阿什递给你一把小巧的刮皮刀：「帮我削几根挂肉的香樟木签。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[回到阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">回到阿什身旁 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpRelDay_ash_5 is 1>>
今日已见过面，不必再打扰。
<br>
