	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[改日清晨再聚 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	夜间泉水冰凉刺骨，冻得你指尖微微发颤。<span class="red">只好先停手缓神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[对齐卡槽刻度再试 (0:04)|MP RelDay Ash 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "借着灯火与他拓下月相纹 (0:09)">><<pass 9>><<replace "#act-mp-relday-ash-6">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpRelDay_ash_6 to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_ash_6")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><</if>>完整的月相古纹跃然纸上，阿什将拓片折好与那枚古币一同塞进你贴身口袋。<span class="green">彼此默契更深。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[约好下次相伴 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
