<<if ($maths or 0) gte 230 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>>账目一分不差，罗宾开心地把多出的几枚铜币塞进共同储蓄盒。<span class="green">罗宾的笑容让整个走廊都暖了起来。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[晚些时候再叙 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	硬币从桌沿滑落两枚滚进床底，你弯腰去摸时磕到了膝盖。<span class="red">罗宾连忙蹲下来替你揉了揉膝头。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起衣袖凑近再试 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮罗宾把零钱码齐 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "拿故事书陪小孤儿读完末章 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-daily-robin-4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 230 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set $daily.mpDaily_robin_4 to 1>>
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>>孩子们听得入神，乖巧地排着队回房睡觉，罗宾感激地牵住你的衣角。<span class="green">你们并肩收拾好木桌准备歇息。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[留下来继续相伴 (0:04)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你念错了两个生僻词，小家伙们叽叽喳喳地缠着你追问。<span class="red">罗宾笑着接过书本替你解了围。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫稳脚下石砖再试 (0:04)|MP Daily Robin 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|Orphanage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

